    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteWanderingCorpse)
    Text: "Marie\u2019s journal"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(CrazedAdventurer)
    Text: "Oh hell no, if I ever make it out from here, I am never going back! Fuck,
      fuck, fuck! I was, am, lost and I had lost all hope. Every single drop. Then,
      a drop of hope came back when I saw another adventurer. That damn adventurer,
      they were supposed to be my way out. I approached them, a simple hi that was
      all. Suddenly that rabid scream. They threw themself at me. I was flung to
      the floor. They were strangling me, that combined with the <color=#800080ff>purple</color>
      smoke. I couldn\u2019t breathe, I couldn't breathe and I had my dagger. I am
      covered in dried blood now, here in the dark. No torch, no one else, and no
      way out."
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteCrazedAdventurer)
    Text: Note from a lost adventurer
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteBlastedWitch)
    Text: 'Diary of Tyrone Marlin

'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteCartographer)
    Text: "Note from a lost cartographer \r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteCursedFamily)
    Text: "Adrien Regin\u2019s journal\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteGavin)
    Text: 'Diary of Gavin

'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteGoffman)
    Text: "\u201CAn ode to my beloved\u201D\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteMagda)
    Text: "Magda Fusilitch\u2019s expedition log\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteStarving)
    Text: 'Note from a starving explorer





'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(BlastedWitch)
    Text: 'Tyrone Marlin- 1413


      That blasted witch! I knew I shouldn''t have
      trusted her with those damn brews. The price was too good to be true. Said
      the potion would heal my wounds she did. But no, now I''m hurting even more
      and my hair seems to be growing like crazy! This didn''t help at all! I can
      hardly move my legs. Don''t trust her I tell you! Don''t buy into her delusions!



'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Cartographer)
    Text: "I\u2019d heard this place was disorienting but this is absurd. It's so
      dark in here that mapping out the entire place in detail would take eons. Not
      to even mention all the freaks that seem to litter the place that I wasn't
      warned about! They make it impossible to get anything done when they\u2019re
      just around every corner waiting for a perfect chance to slice your head off.
      I should have just brought some firewood and found a nice empty space. Maybe
      then I would've had some peace in here.  \r\n\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Gavin)
    Text: "Gavin\u2019s diary\r\n\r\nTo any unfortunate fool that somehow sees this,
      please listen.\r\nThese things are more powerful than I thought. Brute strength
      won\u2019t save you against them. However they are sloppy and predictable.
      If you manage to parry their attacks then they are likely to stagger in shock,
      just be sure to strike them back when you have the chance. And if you feel
      overwhelmed, run, get out of this damn place when you still have a mind to
      keep. Don't be like me. Don't die for nothing. \r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Goffman)
    Text: "<i>\u201CAn ode to my beloved\u201D<i>\r\n\r\nGazing into your deep blue
      eyes I see it shine. \r\nOceans of love and tender care.\r\nFaster my heart
      beats as a look upon you. \r\nFurther and further I fall into your embrace.\r\nMagic
      like that of the gods of stars.\r\nAching only when you leave my side.\r\nNo
      one can replace you, no one.\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Starving)
    Text: "I have been down here for over a day now. I can not find my way out anymore
      and I have run out of food and I am sure as hell not gonna find anything edible
      down here. Damn it, damn it all! If only I would have brought more. Maybe then
      I would not be shambling my way through here with a rumbling stomach. \r\nTo
      anyone lucky enough to be alive. If you know how to get back out. Get yourself
      a hearty meal before going any deeper, You won't make it very far without it.
      Better yet, just get out of here.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(Ration)
    Text: "A meal of nice looking food from aiden. It tastes worse than it looks.\nUse
      it to rest and recover energy. \n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: HowIMetYourMaid
    Text: I saw her and she was there
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: TheArgonianMaid
    Text: Example text, not for sale
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(Adventurer'sSword)
    Text: '<i>Adventurer''s sword</i>

      A common and reliable sword often wielded
      by amateur adventurers and explorers.



'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(DamascusSword)
    Text: "<i>Dark metal blade</i>\r\nA sharp and powerful blade with a swirling
      pattern made with techniques from lands far from Gunhildr. \r\n\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(Ingrid'sSword)
    Text: "<i>Ingrid\u2019s sword</i>\r\nA shoddy sword forged long ago by Yngvarr.
      It looks like it could shatter at any moment. \r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(Rope)
    Text: "A coil of rope bought in town. It's quite prickly.  \r\n\r\nUse it to
      reach otherwise unreachable locations. \r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(BagOfCoins)
    Text: 'A bag of old coins. They look different somehow. It is not of a usable
      currency, could however be sold.

'
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(Spindle)
    Text: A suspended spindle with a fancy silken thread still attached. It amazes
      you how it still is so clean. The silken thread can be sold for money.
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Syn'sMother)
    Text: "To Syn\r\n\r\nForgive me Syn. Your mother has been very foolish.\r\nI
      know you will probably never see this but on the off chance you do I need you
      to know I\u2019m very proud of you. Even though you hide your feelings behind
      your harsh words, I can tell that you really do care about the people around
      you. And I think they know too. \r\nYet I still went down here thinking I\u2019d
      find something. And I can\u2019t even remember what it was.\r\nSyn.. I\u2019m
      sorry. I\u2019m sorry that I\u2019ll never get to see you again. I\u2019m sorry
      that I couldn\u2019t be a better mother. Do tell your father that I love him
      okay? And of course.\r\nI love you Syn. I hope you live a long and happy life.\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Children)
    Text: "They are children, the children are everywhere. No matter where I look,
      where I touch they are there. They may be on my very body without my knowledge.
      I\u2019m afraid. I can\u2019t find the way out. My trail was eaten by the hidden
      children. The hidden children will be my death\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE \r\n<color=#800000ff><b>THEY
      ARE IN MY SKIN, IN MY SKIN, IN MY SKIN. I NEED THEM OUT OUT OUT OUT OUT OUT.
      GET GET GET GET GET THEM ou-.</b></color>\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(JessJournal)
    Text: "Jess\u2019s journal\r\n\r\nEver since I got here to Gunhildr all I hear
      is Agathol this and Agathol that. Is there truly nothing else in this CITY,
      mind you, than this blasted dungeon? That\u2019s what most of the locals seem
      to convey at least. I don\u2019t get it. It doesn\u2019t seem that out of the
      ordinary from what I can gather.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE I get it now, I now see why
      so many venture down. Everything is down there. Everything I could ever want,
      everything I\u2019ll ever need. I\u2019ll be there soon, Agathol.\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Magda)
    Text: "\r\nWe have officially uncovered uncharted territory. No one I've talked
      to seems to have ever made it so far down. No one that\u2019s not still down
      here anyway. The place is still crawling with madmen, Seems to be even more
      of them then usual.\r\nAnd the voices have only started getting louder. But
      me and my boys are gonna keep heading down further. And I\u2019ll be damned
      if we don't try our hardest. We\u2019ll be the once to destroy whoever or whatever
      is in charge of this accursed place. \r\n\r\nMagda Fusilitch - 1462\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE\r\n\r\nIt's
      just me left. The others lost their minds and ran off. Before they did they
      acted almost as if they were getting devoured from the inside out. I guess
      it's only a matter of time before I end up like them.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE\r\n\r\n<color=#F500C0>I</color>
      <color=#D700B8>S</color><color=#C900B5>A</color><color=#BA00B1>W</color> <color=#9D00AA>I</color><color=#8E00A6>T</color>\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(CursedFamily)
    Text: "Adrien Regin\u2019s Journal\r\n\r\nI don't want to do this yet every single
      one of my damn dimwitted family members expects the lot of us to go down there.
      Damn it all! I don't remember signing up for this when my mother birthed me,
      but I guess that's just how it goes with us. Sending each and every one of
      us to an early grave. And for what? Money? Glory? That all disappeared ages
      ago! Oh how I envy the newborns right now. They don\u2019t know yet what awaits
      them. Hell, if things don't change, then they will probably be the last generation
      of our idiotic family.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE WHY WHY WHY? Why did I have to be born
      into this fucking family!? Curse them, CURSE THEM ALL!\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Richness)
    Text: "I\u2019m rich! Rich, rich, rich, rich, rich, rich. I am at the top of
      the class. I can buy anything now, live in the mansion I\u2019ve always dreamed
      about and of course get all of the girls. No more will I be looked down upon
      by those filthy folks. HA HA HA. It is time to go and flaunt all of my wealth
      over those filthies and buy whatever I want.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE My wealth, it
      is not enough, I am not enough. Only a fraction of my dreams have come true
      so far. And everyone, everyone is either wanting to steal my wealth or is gaining
      on it with their own adventures. I have to go back down, earn more wealth,
      become more rich. I have to climb, become more rich. Tomorrow I will go back
      down to Agathol.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE <b>GOLD, WEALTH, RICHES, CROWNS.</b> I want
      them all, it is all mine, mine, mine, mine. I am gonna go down tomorrow too,
      otherwise everybody else will reach my level and nobody can reach my level.
      They are <i><b>ALL FILTH.</b></i>\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Confidence)
    Text: "Ha, this is easier than I thought. You can just sneak by all these other
      adventurers and loot to your hearts content. If this would be the only danger
      this \u201CAgathol\u201D had to offer then everyone must be weak and pathetic!
      Hahaha, this is ea-"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(MyVoice)
    Text: "Diary of Morrigan\r\nEntry 1\r\n\r\nHere my thoughts feel so clear, but
      divided at the same time. I\u2019ve been going down to think through some of
      my problems and I solved every single one! In my regular life, up there, everything
      in my life is a problem. Everyone I\u2019ve ever befriended I accidentally
      pushed away. Money always seems too short for my living. I could never solve
      these problems until I went down to Agathol. It has some annoyance to it, that
      my brain comes up with multiple things to think about.\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE\r\n<i>D<i>i<i>a<i>R<i>y<i>
      <i>o<i>f <i>M<i>o<i>r<i>r<i>i<i>g<i>a<i>n\r\n<i>E<i>n<i>T<i>r<i>y 2<i>\r\n\r\n<b>IT
      IS SO MUCH! MY THOUGHTS ARE EVERYWHERE. I CAN\u2019T CONTROL THEM. I CAN\u2019T
      THINK WHAT I WANT TO THINK. THERE IS NO DIFFERENCE BETWEEN MY THOUGHTS AND
      MY VOICE. WHEN AM I SPEAKING?! WHEN AM I THINKING?!<b>\r\n\r\n\u2026\r\n\r\nI
      don\u2019t think it is my thoughts inside my head.\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Traps)
    Text: "Diary of Yvonne Joergenson\r\n\r\nI got called down here to Gunhildr to
      look at a dungeon they apparently call \u201CAgathol\u201D, awfully odd name
      for such a place but who am I to judge? No matter though, after all I\u2019ve
      gotten offered a pretty penny to look at the traps that apparently are housed
      within and disarm them. Seems easy enough. Place seems old from what I've heard
      so it shouldn\u2019t be anything complicated. \r\n\r\nTURNPAGE Turns out, I
      was half right. The traps here are mostly obvious and easy to spot however
      they are brutal and I can't find any way to disarm them permanently. Whenever
      I cut one of the tripwires they assemble themselves back again as soon as I
      look away. These traps definitely aren\u2019t normal, and I assume there\u2019s
      some sort of magic trickery with it. In other words, this is not a job for
      me. Now I just gotta get out before I accidentally step on one of them. \r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(RuinFun)
    Text: "October 19, 1473. We finally found something worth bringing back. Well
      \u201Cworth\u201D is a strong word. All it is a purple gemstone. Probably an
      amethyst of some kind, barely worth 50 crowns. I told the others such but they
      all snapped at me. Going on about me \u201Cruining their fun\u201D? \r\nI don't
      get it. These shitheads have gotten weird.  \r\n\r\nTURNPAGE\r\n\r\nWhY DO
      yOu RuIN OuR fUNn??\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteConfidence)
    Text: Diary of an overconfident explorer
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteMyVoice)
    Text: Diary of an anxious traveler
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Description(NoteTraps)
    Text: Journal of a trapsmith
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(Edwards)
    Text: "Edwards journal. \r\nEntry 15\r\nThe numerous tales of the so-called \u201CAgathol\u201D
      have led me to the city of Gunhildr where it was said to lie. It turns out
      the rumors were true. This place is crawling with seasoned and amateur explorers
      alike, all roaring to get to the bottom of the dungeon and loot whatever treasures
      are hidden within. Although I have heard some more concerning tales as well.
      Apparently people rarely return, and the few that do often aren't too happy
      to talk about it. \r\nI can't quite wrap my head around why so many people
      are risking their lives to explore that place. Although, I myself have gotten
      a strange inclination to do the same.\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
  - Name: Note(SacredGods)
    Text: "Oh sacred gods above the stars, If you can hear me, please answer my prayers
      true. This place is profane beyond anything else in this mortal realm. And
      so I beg thee cast this hell out of our world so it may never defile any other
      poor soul untouched by your grace.\r\n\r\nPlease I beg you\u2026 Why? Why is
      it the voice of the damned I hear, and not that of yours?\r\n\r\nTURNPAGE I
      can see it now, clear as the brightest star. The answers, the answers to it
      all. They are found here. We should not run from it. We should not fear it.
      We should not reject it. \r\nWE SHOULD EMBRACE IT. WE SHOULD BECOME IT. FOR
      AGATHOL IS ALL. AGATHOL IS EVERYTHING. WHY DIDN\u2019T I REALIZE?\r\nWE ARE
      AGATHOL AND AGATHOL WILL GRANT US TRUTH.\r\n\r\n"
    IsInJournal: 0
